              "text": "<h1><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span style=\"color: #ffb500;\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-5em\">Sage heel protector OR</span></span></span></h1>\n<h2><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Protects heels and safely secures lower limbs in the operating room.</span></h2>\n",
